        "created_at": "2023-01-25T02:32:04.736Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Help is definitely wanted here! Challenge Mode Miss Information vs. Akash’Thriya: Spirit of the Void, America’s Newest Legacy, Freedom Six Tachyon and Void Guard Mainstay at Fort Adamant.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d\" title=\"IMG_4974\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_4974\" data-base62-sha1=\"xLaRChf0rkZ73OozI0QO6fWitRz\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ec9ce96549bae0d9850d293a360aa30d1beb881d_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_4974</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 193 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Got beat pretty good the first time by not respecting Miss Information’s ongoing and equipment destruction and not having all the great cards I wanted around to help me out. Got much better in the second round, with completely different draws from the environment and the villain deck. It was still a clue fest of epic proportions a few turns into both games with 6-10 cards played in a single turn, which leads to a lot of damage as soon as she flipped. But in my second game, I had a much better setup and could weather the storm.</p>",
