        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that was my experience as well. She flipped, immediately played two clues, then a Diversionary Tactics that dropped two diversions onto the field, then another clue, then another Diversionary Tactic for a third diversion, then a fourth clue, and Another Reality’s Debt.</p>\n<p>And then I noped out and I don’t think I’m going to bother going back. Challenge Mode Miss Info is the worst.</p>",
