        "id": 250471,
        "name": "",
        "username": "Thunderbird",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-27T00:19:44.589Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e\" title=\"20230126191239_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230126191239_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"Ah3aHu8U3fflrJruSwLu7qnnWyO\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fe3bb1d1ddf2ff5870bbdc55c70b182a7bd7cb8e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230126191239_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 372 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Blech! It wasn’t pretty, but there you go. Basically skip any Ongoings until she flips cause she’s gonna trash it all anyway. Had all the target Diversions at low HP and had to make creative use of targeting to get around Misplaced Memo. Once the Diversions were cleared and <strong>both</strong> Memos were gone, I just piled on until I burned out. Incapped Young Legacy gave a damage boost to Tachyon when she had two Lightspeed Barrages in hand that took Aminia down to 1 HP, then Aggressive Volunteering finished her off. Not a moment too soon!</p>",
