        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kNZ6MGUrwiLjqye4KV7vkl1vkC4\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/91d1fa6b8adbb0001ea80b73b1c128e8dc6fdd80_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 174 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Not gonna lie, I’m not fully certain what I did, but I really enjoyed having Akash’s “+2 by Environment cards” incap in the last round to boost the EMP Cannon for two attacks of 7 each.</p>",
