        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-27T11:08:26.588Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472\" title=\"Screenshot_20230127-050523\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20230127-050523\" data-base62-sha1=\"q7tXRtAkRsWKyEcVNvY0R2OZnfY\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b71113d8cd250b2378a3238e729af9402649e472_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20230127-050523</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 99 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Yeah, I’m not even trying to Good this one.  The only way I can see dealing with all the Missing Resources and similar issues is to write down every card play, rewinding over and over until we get a loadout we can handle.  That much effort will eventually guarantee a win, but is so tedious and miserable that I’ll have to be extremely bored before I try it.</p>",
